-- statement:
--   Verbatim transplant of the Lean module `CKLaneC.RST2.U_0200 (part 1 of 3)` of the machine-checked proof of the general Courtade–Kumar theorem (the most informative Boolean function conjecture), so that the complete proof can be verified on this platform.
